optOutNotificationMethods.description:
Exact notification method names the client declines; no wildcards;
unknown names accepted and ignored; the protected set (SS1.7) cannot
be opted out.

emittedAtMs.description:
Emission time in Unix milliseconds, recorded once at emission;
server→client notifications only (SS1.2.5). Optional on the wire so
decoders tolerate older servers.

windowTokens.description:
The effective context-window size from the host's pressure basis;
absent when the basis has no limit — the limit part is omitted,
never invented (tdd SS4.6.6).
